      <p class="c5"><span class="c12 c11">Re: Proposal for Rating of {!Opportunity.CurrencyDisplayFormula__c}  {!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c} {!Opportunity.Crore_or_Million__c} {!Opportunity.Instrument_type_4__c } </span></p>
      <p class="c5 c4"><span class="c32 c11 c27"></span></p>
   
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">This has the reference to our discussion regarding the rating of your company as per captioned details.</span><span class="c9">&nbsp;</span><span class="c0">In accordance, we are pleased to submit our proposal for rating of the above-mentioned programme.</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">The enclosed note contains the following sections:</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <apex:outputText escape="false">
      <p class="c15"><strong>Part I</strong><span class="c11 c24" style="padding-left:67px;">:</span><span class="c0"> Credentials of ICRA</span></p>
      <p class="c15"><strong>Part II</strong><span class="c11 c24" style="padding-left:61px;">:</span><span class="c0"> Expertise, Coverage and ICRA&rsquo;s Advantage</span></p>
