      <p class="c15"><strong>Part IV</strong><span class="c11 c24" style="padding-left:56px;">:</span><span class="c11"> Commercial Terms</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      </apex:outputText>
    
      <h2 class="c15 c39"><span class="c0">Please feel free to discuss with us if you need any clarification. You may contact us at the below mentioned. </span></h2>
     
      <h2 class="c15 c39"><span class="c0">We look forward to work on this assignment and assure you of our best services.</span></h2>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">Sincerely,</span></p>
      <p class="c3 c4"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c3 c4"><span class="c0"></span></p>
   

      
      <p><span class="c0"></span></p>
