      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c3 subtitle"><span class="c6">Alliance with Moody&rsquo;s Investors Service</span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c11">The International rating agency, Moody&#39;s Investors Service, through its investment arm based in India is the largest shareholder in ICRA. ICRA is now designated as a Moody&rsquo;s Investors Service Company. Moody&#39;s and ICRA also have a technical services agreement which entails Moody&#39;s providing technical inputs to ICRA. Specifically, the agreement is aimed at benefiting ICRA&#39;s in-house research capabilities and provides access to Moody&#39;s global research base.&nbsp;Moody&#39;s association with ICRA brings to India the global expertise and research, which Moody&#39;s has developed over the past nine decades of their existence. ICRA&#39;s association with Moody&#39;s is an important step towards the continuing process of building a strong Rating system in India.</span><span class="c41 c27">&nbsp;</span></p>
