      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">ICRA has built expertise in the major sectors. The key specialty areas include: </span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <ul class="c19 lst-kix_list_1-0 start" style="text-indent: -6px; ">
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-1" style="list-style-type: disc" ><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Corporate sector including Transport Corporations, Engineering and Electricals, Cement &amp; Building Materials, PEBs, Power, Solar &amp; Wind Energy, Engineering, Healthcare, Pharmaceuticals, Information Technology, Steel, Sugar, Power, Automobile, Textile, Hotels, Metals and mining, Media, Retail, etc.</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-1"  style="list-style-type: disc"><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Public finance including state governments, municipal and urban local bodies.</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-2" style="list-style-type: disc;" ><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Financial sector including NBFCs, Banks, financial services &amp; insurance companies.</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-2" style="list-style-type: disc" ><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Infrastructure and utilities including Oil and Gas, Irrigation, Roads, Buildings, Telecom and Transportation sector.</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-1"  style="list-style-type: disc"><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Real Estate &amp; Construction Entities</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-1"  style="list-style-type: disc"><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Structured Finance</span></li>
         <li class="c15 c23 li-bullet-1"  style="list-style-type: disc"><span class="c0" style="padding-left: 5px;">Economic Research</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="c1 c29"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p><a href="https://www.icraresearch.in/Research/SubscribeSector"><i>Click here to view ICRA's Research Services</i></a></p>
      <p class="c1 c29"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">These sectors are headed by a Group Head who, in turn, is supported by a team of sector heads &amp; dedicated analysts. Sector focus provides a specialized approach, higher level of rating consistency and faster turnaround times. &nbsp;With a long track record and expertise available within, ICRA is well placed to scale up in case of necessity. Nine offices across the country enable comprehensive geographic coverage. </span></p>
      <p class="c1"><span class="c0"></span></p>
      <p class="c15"><span class="c0">ICRA has already conducted Rating of a sizeable number of companies across various sectors. Through this, ICRA has acquired a deep understanding of the factors affecting the performance of the industry as well as the Company. Given this, ICRA is very well placed to complete an assignment of this nature. </span></p>
